{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/刺盾","pageid":1875,"revid":11626,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%BA%E7%9B%BE&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%BA%E7%9B%BE&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%88%BA%E7%9B%BE&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>刺盾</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.88.BA.E7.9B.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"刺盾\"><b>刺盾</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 刺盾.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/7bo9rkkjkf8qnlw4fwta85qcf1r976r.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%88%BA%E7%9B%BE.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e2/7bo9rkkjkf8qnlw4fwta85qcf1r976r.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%88%BA%E7%9B%BE.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e2/7bo9rkkjkf8qnlw4fwta85qcf1r976r.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />刺盾\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[反应]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（反应）被主动攻击时，受到伤害降低<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>。被主动近战攻击时，进行[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"反击\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">反击</font></span></span>]，可造成对方[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"穿透伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">穿透伤害</font></span></span>]，伤害为自身物防值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">50%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E5%90%8C%E7%9B%9F%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/骑士同盟剑盾骑士\"><img alt=\"头像 骑士同盟剑盾骑士.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/8b/johabo8h5pu53g872e6pxptzkpfyy6j.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">骑士同盟剑盾骑士</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E7%9B%BE%E5%8D%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/